          "section": "10.5.9.4",
          "html_line": 588
        }
      ],
      "text": "You can use the Interval Size slider and the Add Interval button to set the number of semitones or scale degrees (if a clip scale is active) by which the pitches of new notes will be shifted in relation to the pitches of the original note selection. This is useful for quickly creating chords.",
      "raw_end": 84834,
      "raw_html": "<p>You can use the Interval Size slider and the Add Interval button to set the number of semitones or scale degrees (if a clip scale is active) by which the pitches of new notes will be shifted in relation to the pitches of the original note selection. This is useful for quickly creating chords.</p>",
      "id": "MIDIQ:B113",
      "source_id": "MIDIQ"
    },
