          "html_line": 624
        }
      ],
      "text": "Humanize adds a variation to note starts times, removing any potential mechanical feel from the composition. The variation percentage is set using the Humanize Amount slider, up to a quarter of a grid division before or after the original note position, and can be applied with the Humanize button.",
      "raw_end": 88432,
      "raw_html": "<p>Humanize adds a variation to note starts times, removing any potential mechanical feel from the composition. The variation percentage is set using the Humanize Amount slider, up to a quarter of a grid division before or after the original note position, and can be applied with the Humanize button.</p>",
